#: ../../source/2.1SDK_Introduction.md:1
msgid "2.1 SDK Introduction"
msgstr "2.1 SDK介绍"

#: ../../source/2.1SDK_Introduction.md:4
msgid ""
"This document describes the Software Development Kit (SDK) for the D1 "
"Max, providing detailed information on its core service interfaces, "
"including high‑level command set interfaces, Inertial Measurement Unit "
"(IMU) inertial navigation data interfaces, and motor status data "
"interfaces."
msgstr "本文档描述了 D1 Max 的软件开发工具包 (SDK)，提供其核心服务接口的详细信息，包括高层运动控制接口、IMU 惯导数据接口、电机状态数据接口。"

#: ../../source/2.1SDK_Introduction.md:5
msgid ""
"Each chapter describes the invocation methods for different service "
"interfaces, the standard format definitions for data input/output, and "
"provides functional development examples."
msgstr "各章节分别介绍不同服务接口的调用方法、数据输入/输出的标准格式定义与一些功能开发示例。"

#: ../../source/2.1SDK_Introduction.md:6
msgid ""
"Interface definitions are subject to change based on production "
"development status. Please refer to the latest version of the interface "
"definition document."
msgstr "接口定义会随量产开发状态产生变更，请以最新版本的接口定义文档为准。"

#: ../../source/2.1SDK_Introduction.md:7
msgid ""
"The SDK communicates with the quadruped robot body program via a specific"
" protocol. Therefore, different SDK versions may have compatibility "
"differences with the robot body software. Please select the SDK version "
"that corresponds to the device version. If conditions permit, it is "
"recommended to update the quadruped robot firmware to the latest version "
"for better compatibility."
msgstr "SDK程序与狗本体内程序通讯存在特定协议，故不同版本的SDK程序设备本体内程序通讯存在差异，请根据设备版本选择对应版本SDK程序。若条件允许，建议更新狗内程序到最新版本，以获得更好的兼容性。"

#: ../../source/2.1SDK_Introduction.md:8
msgid ""
"When controlled via the SDK interfaces, all states are designed and "
"specified by the secondary developer. The robot body motion controller "
"does not perform additional intervention or state transitions."
msgstr "SDK接口控制时，全部状态均由二次开发者设计指定，本体运控不做额外的干预与状态跳转。"

#: ../../source/2.1SDK_Introduction.md:9
msgid ""
"When running the SDK, please ensure that the system has sufficient "
"resources; otherwise, the motion control module may fail."
msgstr "运行SDK时, 请保证系统有足够的资源, 否则可能出现运动控制模块失效的情况。"

